      "id": "claim_595f8910f0ec49cb9ee9c4b2c65320a9",
      "statement": "LangSmith merges `SANDBOX_CREATE_EXTRA_JSON` with call-specific create parameters (the latter wins), and injects unsupported fields only into the SDK's `POST /boxes` create request; normal creation retries retryable failures up to three attempts.",
