    {
      "id": "claim_173bfcf31a744bf88c35f727a43c3e61",
      "statement": "Command retries are limited to `SandboxRetryableConnectionError`, a rejected WebSocket upgrade before the execute frame is sent, and use at most four jittered exponential-backoff attempts to avoid double-running a command.",
